6,100–102"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source containment statements checked; complete bootstrapping proof not reproduced"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\mathsf\\Sigma_n,B\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\">\\(I\\mathsf\\Sigma_n,B\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44d76667d32d9bbd\" href=\"?note=44d76667d32d9bbd\" title=\"72-df-first-order-induction-fragments\">72-df-first-order-induction-fragments</a>；所有可证性使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}\\)</span> 的含等式有限 Hilbert 演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\quad\n\\bigl(I\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\\vdash A\\Rightarrow B\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(B\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\Rightarrow I\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\quad\n\\bigl(I\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\\vdash A\\Rightarrow B\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(B\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\Rightarrow I\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应源包含图中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"IΣ_n\\subseteq BΣ_{n+1}\\subseteq IΣ_{n+1}\">\\(IΣ_n\\subseteq BΣ_{n+1}\\subseteq IΣ_{n+1}\\)</span>，这里用理论后果包含而非伪装成字面公理子集。书中还讨论这些包含的严格性；本节点只录上述包含，并未重做所需 bootstrapping 与一般收集证明，保留来源陈述核对的证据限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-induction-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"44d76667d32d9bbd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-induction-fragments","status":"resolved","id":"44d76667d32d9bbd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$，$I\\mathsf\\Sigma_n,B\\mathsf\\Sigma_n$ 使用 [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]]；所有可证性使用同一 $\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}$ 的含等式有限 Hilbert 演算。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"I\\mathsf\\Sigma_n,B\\mathsf\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\quad\n\\bigl(I\\mathsf\\Sigma_n\\vdash A\\Rightarrow B\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\bigr)\\land\n\\bigl(B\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\Rightarrow I\\mathsf\\Sigma_{n+1}\\vdash A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"IΣ_n\\subseteq BΣ_{n+1}\\subseteq IΣ_{n+1}","display":false}],"bytes":1710,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] · [[72-thm-arithmetic-induction-collection-chain]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-485","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增5项：[[72-df-arithmetic-minimization-collection]] · [[72-df-first-order-arithmetic-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-first-order-induction-fragments]] · [[72-lem-arithmetic-hierarchy-inclusions]] 